# G10 invalid booking requests: log in first with your REST client cookie jar.
# All requests below must return 400 and create no records.
@base_url = http://localhost:3000
@property_id = dcd91068-9f88-496f-a239-305f54fdc957

### Impossible calendar date
POST {{base_url}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"property_id":"{{property_id}}","guest_name":"Validation Guest","guest_email":"guest@example.com","check_in":"2028-02-30","check_out":"2028-03-02","guests":1}

### Checkout before check-in
POST {{base_url}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"property_id":"{{property_id}}","guest_name":"Validation Guest","guest_email":"guest@example.com","check_in":"2028-03-02","check_out":"2028-03-01","guests":1}

### Blank name, invalid email, fractional guests
POST {{base_url}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"property_id":"{{property_id}}","guest_name":"   ","guest_email":"invalid","check_in":"2028-03-01","check_out":"2028-03-02","guests":1.5}

### Past check-in: 400
POST {{base_url}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"property_id":"{{property_id}}","guest_name":"Validation Guest","guest_email":"guest@example.com","check_in":"2000-01-01","check_out":"2000-01-02","guests":1}
